@choose_candidate
on-arrival: {!
!}

Who should we run for president?

- @Heinemann: Gustav Heinemann

@Heinemann
subtitle: Former <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> member, now justice minister of the <span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span>

We run Gustav Heinemann as our candidate.

The <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> runs Gerhard Schröder, the defense minister, as their candidate.

- @FDP_choice: Who will the <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span> and <span style="color: #c26f2b;">**NPD**</span> support?

@FDP_choice

The <span style="color: #FFCC00;">liberals</span> have decided to support our candidate! The <span style="color: #c26f2b;">**NPD**</span> delegates seem to vote for Schröder...

- @vote: Results...

@vote

{!<table>!} 
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote Share</td>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#c00000; outline: 2px; outline-style: solid;'> </div> !} Gustav Heinemann: {!</td><td>!} **49,6%**

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#000000'> </div> !} Gerhard Schröder: {!</td><td>!} 48,4% {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

**First Round Results:**

Due to not all delegates arriving in Berlin and some abstaining, no one has reached an absolute majority! A second vote will be held.

- @vote2: Results...

@vote2

{!<table>!} 
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote Share</td>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#c00000; outline: 2px; outline-style: solid;'> </div> !} Gustav Heinemann: {!</td><td>!} **49,3%**

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#000000'> </div> !} Gerhard Schröder: {!</td><td>!} 48,9% {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

**Second Round Results:**

There still isn't any absolute majority. A third vote will be held, where a simple majority is enough to be elected.

- @vote3: Results...

@vote3
on-arrival: president = "Heinemann"

{!<table>!} 
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote Share</td>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#c00000; outline: 2px; outline-style: solid;'> </div> !} Gustav Heinemann: {!</td><td>!} **49,4%**

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#000000'> </div> !} Gerhard Schröder: {!</td><td>!} 48,8% {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

**Third Round Results:**

Gustav Heinemann of the <span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span> has been elected president! Our successful cooperation with the <span style="color: #FFCC00;">liberals</span> has interesting implications for the next Bundestag election...
